#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Decide whether a Workspace CI event must run the fractal-web execution lane.

Pull requests diff the immutable base and head SHAs from their merge base; merge groups diff the
queued group's base_sha..head_sha and pushes diff before..after, including every pushed commit.
Both commits are fetched explicitly. Renames are split into a deletion and an addition, so both
paths are matched. If the diff cannot be determined, all web lanes run. Manual runs always execute.
"""

